  "cards": [
    {
      "title": "Revision and transaction",
      "items": [
        "Creation uses an empty expected revision; updates require the current source revision. Unchanged normalized source retains its revision.",
        "Publishing replaces complete set membership while preserving existing assignments. Source, declarations and change rows commit together with the configured transaction runner."
      ],
      "dot": "storage"
    },
    {
      "title": "Publication is server state",
      "items": [
        "Target-aware validation is an optional preview. Publish validates with an empty support.Target, persists desired state, and leaves synchronization and activation to the device.",
        "The Blueprint source revision differs from declaration ServerToken values. Removing an item withdraws it from this set; retained versions and uploaded profile bytes have their own stores.",
        "Publication notifies existing assignments too. Adding or removing membership is a separate enrollment-scoped operation."
      ],
      "dot": "policy"
    },
    {
      "title": "Configuration profile references",
      "items": [
        "Uploaded profiles supply a public HTTPS download URL and integrity metadata. Profile storage and authenticated device downloads remain owned by configurationprofile."
      ],
      "dot": "artifact"
    },
